   179	    sanity controls whose paper_variable flag does not enter the published
   180	    counts. D1 truth frequencies are non-contemporaneous literature
   181	    tabulations (multi-mode DAVs wander between epochs); frequency-recovery
   182	    scoring for D1 is therefore DIAGNOSTIC ONLY (METRICS_SPEC) and D1's
   183	    estimand is detection completeness."""
   184	    master = pd.read_csv(
